      "id": "FAM:SF-APPS-067",
      "status_as_recorded": "supported",
      "finding": "3/64 transition cells (opponent play type → your offense PPP) survived def-match, off-match, prev_made, and BH-FDR: SPOT_UP→TRANSITION -0.085, POST_UP→TRANSITION -0.083, PNR→DRIVE -0.058. Most 64 cells were null."
