      "id": "FAM:SF-APPA-061",
      "status_as_recorded": "untestable",
      "finding": "Agent ablation (n=40 pairs) median regret V4 0.102 vs V5 0.067, Holm p=0.062, McNemar p=0.118. Override hit rate 25% (0-100% CI). Brittle precision 7.5%."
