    {
      "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
      "text": "Per-transition cell counts may be insufficient for rare play types; power analysis on historical transition frequencies is needed before committing to all play types."
    },
    {
      "code": "CONFOUNDING",
      "text": "Defensive team identity, opponent offensive strength, and game context (score margin, period) are strongly predictive of opponent PPP and must be controlled, ideally via matching or fixed effects."
